 "name_en": "Advanced Credit Management (1QM)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Advanced Credit Management (1QM)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio8c604ccd0c104284b0a235d843f3bc17\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8c604ccd0c104284b0a235d843f3bc17__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The credit worthiness and payment behavior of your business partners has an immediate effect on the business results of your company. Efficient receivables and credit management reduce the risk of financial losses, helping you to optimize business relationships with your business partners. Advanced Credit Management supports your company with making an early determination of the risk of losses on receivables from your business partners, and with efficiently making credit decisions. Using automatic calculation via formulas that can be defined flexibly, the Credit Controller can quickly and efficiently make credit decisions. Advanced Credit Management checks the exposure against the current credit limit for the business partner. You can check the credit limit when sales documents, service orders, or service contracts are created or changed. Moreover, credit limit requests can be executed. In addition, you can also perform other checks, such as oldest open item, maximum dunning level, or last payment. If the new order is blocked, the blocked order can be released or rejected by authorized staff.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8c604ccd0c104284b0a235d843f3bc17__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Calculate rating, risk class, and credit limit for new and existing customers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create or change sales order, service order, or service contract</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Check exposure against credit limit</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage credit accounts</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage blocked orders</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform credit limit request</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Run credit management reports</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Import credit account hierarchies</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8c604ccd0c104284b0a235d843f3bc17__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce risk of bad debt</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Calculate rating, risk class, and credit limit automatically (eventing)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform credit limit requests</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Focus on reliable and profitable customers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Check credit worthiness quickly</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Accelerate the process of checking a customer credit limit</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>高级信用管理 (1QM)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio8c604ccd0c104284b0a235d843f3bc17\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8c604ccd0c104284b0a235d843f3bc17__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">业务伙伴的信用度和付款行为，立即对公司的业务结果产生影响。高效的应收账款和信用管理可降低财务损失的风险，帮助您优化与业务伙伴的业务关系。高级信用管理支持贵公司尽早确定来自业务伙伴的应收账款的损失风险，并有效制定信用决策。通过可灵活定义的公式使用自动计算，信用控制员可以快速有效地做出信用决策。高级信用管理根据业务伙伴的当前信用额度检查敞口。您可以在创建或更改销售凭证、服务订单或服务合同时检查信用额度。此外，可以执行信用额度申请。此外，您还可以执行其他检查，例如最早未清项目、最高催款级别或上次付款。如果新订单已冻结，授权员工可以下达或拒绝冻结的订单。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8c604ccd0c104284b0a235d843f3bc17__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">计算新客户和现有客户的评级、风险类和信用额度</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建或更改销售订单、服务订单或服务合同</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据信用额度检查敞口</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理信用账户</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理冻结订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行信用额度申请</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">运行信用管理报表</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">导入信用账户层次结构</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio8c604ccd0c104284b0a235d843f3bc17__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">降低坏账风险</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动计算评级、风险类和信用额度（事件）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行信用额度申请</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">专注于可靠、可盈利的客户</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">快速检查信用度</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">加速检查客户信用额度的流程</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
